        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>version</name>
        <qualifiedname>ndigo_init_parameters::version</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Version number. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>It is increased when the definition of the structure is changed. The increment can be larger than one to match driver version numbers or similar.</para>
<para>Set to 0 for all versions up to first release.</para>
<para>Must be set to <ref refid="group__constants_1gac907ec25e02b2509b71255b51edd284d" kindref="member">NDIGO_API_VERSION</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
